{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03830","headline":"奉和圣制龙池篇 · 姚崇","name":"奉和圣制龙池篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恭闻帝里生灵沼，应报明君鼎业新。\n既协翠泉光宝命，还符白水出真人。\n此时舜海潜龙跃，此地尧河带马巡。\n独有前池一小雁，叨承旧惠入天津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚崇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}